Error [jet.ComputedFieldAssigned]: `path` is a computed field on `Lock` — it can't be assigned
  --> tests/ui/computed_field_write_immutable_owner.jet:8:10
    |
  8 |     lock.path = "/etc/passwd"
    |          ^^^^
 Why: `path` is declared `path -> …`: its value always comes from that formula, so it has no storage to write, lend for writing or take
 Fix: Change the stored field its formula reads, or call a method of `Lock` that does
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0339
